      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 2669,
        "name": "盈满之实",
        "desc": "<p>从兰那罗的故事中得到的果实。其中蕴含着战胜任何危机的潜能。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2022/08/25/47826599/0e1cecaeba7b12c8c9adcb2f11eccd5e_1820999900382833429.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 4
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomImage",
        "url": "https:/upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2023/08/28/35428890/38e08585c7d0ce883befb28cb8bccd5b_4419009820295181032.png",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 757,
        "name": "摩拉",
        "desc": "通行大陆的钱。世界通用的共同语言，谁人都能理解的贵金属。",
        "iconUrl": "https://bbs.hoyolab.com/hoyowiki/picture/object/Mora_icon.png",
        "amount": 500,
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 9
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 2806,
        "name": "央陆法器原胚",
        "desc": "<p>生产武器的原材料。通过锻造，可以生产出4星的法器。</p><p>哲学中认为尘世间事物，皆具备四种成因。这些原胚的「目的」，正是成为陪伴英雄的武器。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2022/09/13/47826599/94ff9dbff4a1a878579fe8b7162d51a6_4710938855194846252.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 9
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 976,
        "name": "水晶块",
        "desc": "未经削切的晶体。在专门处理后，才能真正展现价值吧。",
        "iconUrl": "https://bbs.hoyolab.com/hoyowiki/picture/object/Crystal Chunk_icon.png",
        "amount": 50,
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 9
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 1224,
        "name": "白铁块",
        "desc": "白铁的矿石，在拥有相应技能的工匠手中能大放异彩吧。",
        "iconUrl": "https://bbs.hoyolab.com/hoyowiki/picture/object/White Iron Chunk_icon.png",
        "amount": 50,
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 9
      },
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "相关锻造图纸"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 2803,
        "name": "关于沙漠的故事",
        "desc": "<p>通过这个故事，能掌握单手剑「原木刀」的制造方法。</p><p> </p><p>这个故事与失落在沙海中的友人有关。</p><p>「这是来自巴螺迦的故事…」</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2022/09/16/47826599/b5fc3494359a9cbc934eead3e40ef526_2617708411422993844.png",
        "displayStyle": "text",
        "menuId": 9
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 2804,
        "name": "关于森林王的故事",
        "desc": "<p>通过这个故事，能掌握双手剑「森林王器」的制造方法。</p><p> </p><p>这个故事与森林王有关。</p><p>「很多、很多个月亮以前，森林是一座巨大的迷宫…」</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2022/09/16/47826599/b5fc3494359a9cbc934eead3e40ef526_7002543752326882560.png",
        "displayStyle": "text",
        "menuId": 9
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 2802,
        "name": "关于月光的故事",
        "desc": "<p>通过这个故事，能掌握长柄武器「贯月矢」的制造方法。 </p><p> </p><p>这个故事与月光的魔力有关。</p><p>「这个故事，与所有为月光所迷的孩子们有关…」</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2022/09/16/47826599/b5fc3494359a9cbc934eead3e40ef526_6047597141322167732.png",
        "displayStyle": "text",
        "menuId": 9
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 2800,
        "name": "关于王的侍从的故事",
        "desc": "<p>通过这个故事，能掌握弓「王下近侍」的制造方法。 </p><p> </p><p>这个故事与迷失在森林的迷宫中的少女有关。</p><p>「很久很久以前，有一名公主…」</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2022/09/16/47826599/b5fc3494359a9cbc934eead3e40ef526_2797956276638615978.png",
        "displayStyle": "text",
        "menuId": 9
      }
